@startuml 04-mission-state-machine
' ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
' Diagram 04: Mission Phase State Machine
' mission_manager_node — Swarm Search Drone MC
' MC-SRS-001  FR-001, FR-002, FR-003
' ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

title "04 — Mission Phase State Machine\nmission_manager_node"

skinparam BackgroundColor #FAFBFC
skinparam DefaultFontColor #1C2334
skinparam DefaultFontSize 10
skinparam TitleFontSize 13
skinparam TitleFontStyle bold
skinparam ArrowColor #3D5A80
skinparam ArrowFontColor #3D5A80
skinparam ArrowFontSize 9

skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #D8E8F8
  BorderColor #3D5A80
  BorderThickness 1.5
  FontSize 10
  FontColor #1C2334
  ArrowColor #3D5A80
}

skinparam StateBorderColor #3D5A80
skinparam StateBackgroundColor #D8E8F8
skinparam StateArrowColor #3D5A80
skinparam StateArrowFontSize 9
skinparam StateArrowFontColor #4A6080

' ── States ──────────────────────────────────────────────────

[*] --> PREFLIGHT : Power-on /\nSystem boot

state PREFLIGHT #B8D4F0 : **PREFLIGHT**\n──────────────\nSelf-test · Peer discovery\nAwait mission upload from GCS\nAll services operational check

state ARMING #C8E4F0 : **ARMING**\n──────────────\nGCS ARM authorisation received\nMC pre-arm checks pass\nFCC arm commanded

state TAKEOFF #C8E4F0 : **TAKEOFF**\n──────────────\nFCC commanded to takeoff mode\nClimb to assigned altitude\nConfirm position hold

state INGRESS #B8E0C8 : **INGRESS**\n──────────────\nFormation keeping active (MISSION or\nOFFBOARD, per-leg plan flag — FCC-009)\nFormation controller → FCC ≥5 Hz\nGCS retains authority

state MUSTER #B8E0C8 : **MUSTER**\n──────────────\nNavigate to muster waypoint\nReport arrival to GCS + peers\nAwait swarm quorum

state ISR_SELECTION #E8D8F8 : **ISR_SELECTION**\n──────────────\nDistributed election algorithm\nBased on: battery · sensor · position\nAll drones participate

state VORONOI_PARTITION #E8D8F8 : **VORONOI_PARTITION**\n──────────────\nExchange positions with peers\nConsensus Voronoi decomposition\nAccept assigned cell (<10 s)

state SEARCH #FFE8C0 : **SEARCH**\n──────────────\nBoustrophedon coverage path\nAI detection inference active\nDetections → GCS in real-time

state RETURN #C8E8C8 : **RETURN**\n──────────────\nNavigate to home waypoint\nMaintain safe altitude

state LAND #C8E8C8 : **LAND**\n──────────────\nFCC land mode commanded\nDescend · Touchdown\nFCC disarm on landing confirm

state FAULT #F8D0D0 : **FAULT**\n──────────────\nCritical failure declared\nRTL commanded via FccBackend\nGCS notified with fault code

[*] <-- LAND : Disarmed

' ── Nominal transitions (GCS-commanded or autonomous) ───────

PREFLIGHT --> ARMING : GCS: ARM authorised\n+ pre-arm checks pass [FR-010]

ARMING --> TAKEOFF : FCC armed ✓\n[FR-012]

TAKEOFF --> INGRESS : Altitude hold confirmed\nGCS: begin ingress

INGRESS --> MUSTER : Muster waypoint reached\n(via FCC mission complete)

MUSTER --> ISR_SELECTION : Swarm quorum reached\n[FR-033]

ISR_SELECTION --> VORONOI_PARTITION : ISR role agreed\n[FR-034]

VORONOI_PARTITION --> SEARCH : Voronoi cell accepted\ncoverage path ready [FR-040]

SEARCH --> RETURN : Coverage path complete\nOR GCS: end-mission [FR-046]

RETURN --> LAND : Home waypoint reached

LAND --> [*]

' ── GCS override transitions (any state → target) ───────────

INGRESS --> RETURN : GCS: abort ingress
MUSTER --> RETURN : GCS: abort mission
ISR_SELECTION --> RETURN : GCS: abort
VORONOI_PARTITION --> RETURN : GCS: abort
SEARCH --> RETURN : GCS: end-mission

' ── Failsafe transitions (any autonomous state) ─────────────

INGRESS -[#CC3333]-> FAULT : FCC link lost >1 s\nOR battery <LOW_THRESHOLD [FR-015]
SEARCH -[#CC3333]-> FAULT : Node restart ×3 failed [FR-075]\nOR battery <LOW_THRESHOLD [FR-072]
VORONOI_PARTITION -[#CC3333]-> FAULT : Critical fault
MUSTER -[#CC3333]-> FAULT : Critical fault

' ── GCS-link-lost HOLD (shown as self-loop note) ────────────
INGRESS -[#E07000]-> INGRESS : GCS link lost >10 s\n→ FCC HOLD commanded [SFR-007]
SEARCH -[#E07000]-> SEARCH : GCS link lost >10 s\n→ FCC HOLD commanded [SFR-007]

FAULT --> [*] : RTL complete\nSystem shutdown

' ── Notes ───────────────────────────────────────────────────

note right of FAULT
  SFR-003: Watchdog → HOLD on
  manager silence >5 s
  SFR-004: 3× restart failure → RTL
end note

note left of ISR_SELECTION
  If drone not selected for ISR:
  transitions directly to RETURN
  after ISR_SELECTION completes
end note

note bottom of VORONOI_PARTITION
  Peer loss during SEARCH (FR-036):
  remaining drones re-run
  VORONOI_PARTITION to redistribute
  uncovered cells
end note

note right of INGRESS
  OFFBOARD is an FCC flight-mode choice
  within this phase, not a separate state.
  mission_manager_node is sole mode-command
  authority — never health_monitor_node.
  Stream-staleness fault (OFFBOARD_STREAM_STALE,
  >500 ms) is handled via the same
  exit-sequencing path as a normal
  OFFBOARD→MISSION phase exit, falling
  back to MISSION (or HOLD if no mission
  loaded)  [SFR-009, design decisions 4-5]
end note

legend right
  | Arrow style | Meaning |
  | Black | Nominal transition |
  | <#CC3333> Red | Failsafe / fault |
  | <#E07000> Orange | GCS-link-loss HOLD |
endlegend

@enduml
